ng the Rust also ignores argv and never touches stdin\n- `cargo build --release` compiles with zero warnings or errors\n- `c_src/` untouched (both files unmodified)\n\nOne note for transparency: `cargo clippy` produced no output at all on this machine, so I could not confirm whether it ran or is simply unavailable in the sandbox — the clean `cargo build` result is the reliable signal here."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":18741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":619,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d49eb447-3596-4c23-8226-ba87819e0768","uuid":"909c5753-ee40-4f7b-b328-3b72499a46b1","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:21:17.257Z"}
